| | MOSI | D7 (GPIO13) | SPI Hardware MOSI |
| | NSS (CS) | D4 (GPIO2) | SPI Chip Select (Pulled HIGH during boot, safe) |
| | RST | **RST** | Resets automatically when NodeMCU resets |
| | DIO0 | D2 (GPIO4) | Interrupt line |
| **HC-SR04** | VCC | 5V (from MT3608 VOUT+) | Sensor power |
| | GND | GND | Common Ground |
| | Trig | D3 (GPIO0) | Trigger pulse input (Pulled HIGH on boot, safe) |
